# Marked Localization Update
# Locale: hu (Hungarian)
# Feature: Folder Navigation, Finder Replace Mode, and Folder Review Queue
# Generated: 2026-11-26
#
# HOW TO TRANSLATE
# ----------------
# Fill in or correct the string on each line: "key" = "your translation";
# Keep keys unchanged. Preserve format specifiers (%lu, %@) unchanged.
# Do not translate product names (Marked, Finder, Dock, Markdown).
#
# CONTEXT
# -------
# History menu adds Next/Previous File in Folder (for single-file windows)
# and Folder Review mode (Review This Folder, Mark Reviewed and Next,
# Mark Unreviewed, Show Review Sidebar) for reviewing batches of files
# in a folder window. SpecialWindows strings appear in the review sidebar
# filter bar and completion banner. Settings strings configure whether
# opening a single file from Finder replaces the frontmost document.
#
# Return this file with translations filled in (same filename).
# Merge with: python3 scripts/merge_localization_updates.py <this-file>

